{"id":"pensamento","lemma":"pensamento","pos":"noun","rank":1593,"glosses":["a thought; an idea","thinking (process by which thoughts arise)","ideology (beliefs and principle of a group)"],"ipa":"/pẽ.sɐˈmẽ.tu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"pensamentos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/16/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Ed_Guimaraes-pensamento.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tom está perdido em seus pensamentos.","en":"Tom is lost in thought.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"lost"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"their or your kin"},null]},{"text":"É um belo pensamento.","en":"That's a nice thought.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"beautiful"},null]},{"text":"Eu queria ser capaz de ler pensamentos.","en":"I wanted to be able to read minds.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/840315","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want","l":"querer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"able, capable"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to read"},null]},{"text":"Você sempre esteve em meus pensamentos.","en":"You were always on my mind.","words":[{"g":"you (formal)"},{"g":"always"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"my kin"},null]},{"text":"Um centavo pelos teus pensamentos.","en":"A penny for your thoughts.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"cent"},null,{"g":"your or thy kin"},null]}]}